Package: lion-session
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Depends: libc6, dbus, systemd (>= 248) | systemd-tmpfiles, python3 (>= 3.9) | lion-compositor
Recommends: lion-notifications
Conflicts: lion-session-dev (<< ${source:Version})
Description: LionOS per-user session supervisor (spec 02)
 Starts and supervises the compositor and every shell service, owns the
 session lifecycle (logout/restart/shutdown/suspend/hibernate/lock/
 switch-user through logind, inhibitors respected) and serves
 os.lionos.Session1 on the session bus.
 .
 Restart policies with crash-loop detection, XDG autostart, safe mode,
 opt-in session restore and systemd Type=notify integration.
